sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as Client
    participant AGW as API Gateway
    participant UserSvc as User Service
    participant Redis as Redis Lua Store
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Client, DB: 1. 정상 refresh rotation
    Client->>AGW: POST /auth/refresh<br/>refresh token cookie
    AGW->>UserSvc: RefreshToken(old_token)
    UserSvc->>Redis: EVAL rotate(old_digest, new_digest, ttl)
    Redis->>Redis: active old 삭제
    Redis->>Redis: used old tombstone 생성<br/>남은 TTL 유지
    Redis->>Redis: active new 생성<br/>auth:rt:active:{new_digest}
    Redis-->>UserSvc: userID 반환
    UserSvc->>DB: GetUserByID(userID)
    DB-->>UserSvc: active user
    UserSvc-->>AGW: new access token + new refresh token
    AGW-->>Client: access token 반환<br/>refresh cookie 교체

    Note over Client, Redis: 2. 이미 사용된 old token 재사용 감지
    Client->>AGW: POST /auth/refresh<br/>old refresh token 재사용
    AGW->>UserSvc: RefreshToken(old_token)
    UserSvc->>Redis: EVAL rotate(old_digest, another_new_digest, ttl)
    Redis->>Redis: used old tombstone 발견
    Redis->>Redis: auth:rt:user:{userID} 조회
    Redis->>Redis: 해당 사용자의 active token 전부 삭제
    Redis-->>UserSvc: reuse detected
    UserSvc-->>AGW: Unauthenticated
    AGW-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized<br/>재로그인 필요

    Note over Client, Redis: 3. 로그아웃과 회원탈퇴
    Client->>AGW: POST /auth/logout
    AGW->>UserSvc: RevokeToken(refresh_token)
    UserSvc->>Redis: active digest 삭제
    Redis-->>UserSvc: revoked

    AGW->>UserSvc: DeleteUser(userID)
    UserSvc->>DB: 방 나가기 처리 + users row 삭제
    UserSvc->>Redis: RevokeUser(userID)
    Redis->>Redis: auth:rt:user:{userID} 기반 active token 삭제
